[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/443443691","html_url":"https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/6815#issuecomment-443443691","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/6815","id":443443691,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ0MzQ0MzY5MQ==","user":{"login":"baryluk","id":110322,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDMyMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110322?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/baryluk","html_url":"https://github.com/baryluk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/baryluk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/baryluk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/baryluk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/baryluk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/baryluk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/baryluk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/baryluk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/baryluk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/baryluk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-12-01T17:38:07Z","updated_at":"2018-12-01T17:47:50Z","body":"Maybe this is because of this https://hg.openjdk.java.net/jdk/jdk11/rev/ef3557eb4306   ?\r\n\r\n```java\r\n    public void warning(int pos, String key, Object ... args) {\r\n```\r\n\r\nwas in fact removed\r\n\r\nOnly option now is usage one of these methods:\r\n\r\n```java\r\n    public void warning(Warning warningKey) {\r\n    public void warning(LintCategory lc, Warning warningKey) {\r\n    public void warning(DiagnosticPosition pos, Warning warningKey) {\r\n    public void warning(LintCategory lc, DiagnosticPosition pos, Warning warningKey) {\r\n    public void warning(int pos, Warning warningKey) {\r\n    public void warning(DiagnosticPosition pos, Warning warningKey) {\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe compiler probably selects overload based on a number of arguments first (because there are no more variadic methods here), and this matches only `warning(LintCategory lc, DiagnosticPosition pos, Warning warningKey)`\r\n\r\nOne of the options to get a `Warning` for warningKey is using a Factory provided\r\n\r\nhttps://hg.openjdk.java.net/jdk/jdk11/file/ef3557eb4306/src/jdk.compiler/share/classes/com/sun/tools/javac/util/JCDiagnostic.java#l305\r\n\r\n```java\r\npublic class JCDiagnostic implements Diagnostic<JavaFileObject> {\r\n\r\n    /** A factory for creating diagnostic objects. */\r\n\r\n    public static class Factory {\r\n// ....\r\n\r\n        Warning warningKey(String code, Object... args);`\r\n// ...\r\n```\r\n\r\nor using Warning constructor directly ( https://hg.openjdk.java.net/jdk/jdk11/file/ef3557eb4306/src/jdk.compiler/share/classes/com/sun/tools/javac/util/JCDiagnostic.java#l561 )\r\n\r\n```java\r\npublic class JCDiagnostic implements Diagnostic<JavaFileObject> {\r\n/// ...\r\n    public static final class Warning extends DiagnosticInfo {\r\n        public Warning(String prefix, String key, Object... args);\r\n/// ...\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/443443691/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"baryluk","id":110322,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDMyMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110322?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/baryluk","html_url":"https://github.com/baryluk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/baryluk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/baryluk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/baryluk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/baryluk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_ur